{
  "version": 1,
  "description": "dsh-plugin-myteam 的项目级检查。规则是数据，执行器是 dsh_project_check 工具或 dsh-plugin-creator 的 scripts/check-project.mjs；规则类型参考该包的 docs/CHECKS.md。",
  "rules": [
    {
      "id": "docs:links",
      "type": "doc-links",
      "exclude": [
        "\\.dsh-memory/",
        "^plugin/lib/"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "locale:parity",
      "type": "locale-parity",
      "files": [
        "locale/en.json",
        "locale/zh.json"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:entry",
      "type": "file-exists",
      "path": "index.js"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:patch",
      "type": "json-field",
      "path": "package.json",
      "field": "dsh.bundle.patch",
      "equals": "./cordis.patch.yml"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:files-listed",
      "type": "files-listed",
      "manifest": "package.json",
      "exclude": [
        ".gitignore",
        ".gitattributes",
        "checks.json",
        "package.json",
        "package-lock.json",
        "README.md",
        "tsconfig.json",
        "test",
        "scripts",
        ".github/workflows/release.yml"
      ],
      "note": "test/ 是仓库内测试与视觉夹具（含无头浏览器 harness），不随包分发；scripts/ 是构建脚本（宿主装载时不需要构建产物以外的它）；package-lock.json 锁的是 devDependencies（typescript / @types/node），只用于类型门禁，宿主装载时不需要。其余为仓库元数据。"
    },
    {
      "id": "arch:layers",
      "type": "import-boundary",
      "root": "src",
      "extensions": [".ts"],
      "layers": {
        "contracts": ["domain", "application", "infrastructure", "composition"],
        "domain": ["application", "infrastructure", "composition"],
        "application": ["infrastructure", "composition"],
        "infrastructure": ["composition"],
        "composition": []
      },
      "builtins": {
        "contracts": ["fs", "child_process", "path", "os", "net", "http", "worker_threads"],
        "domain": ["fs", "child_process", "path", "os", "net", "http", "worker_threads"],
        "application": ["fs", "child_process", "path", "os", "net", "http", "worker_threads"]
      },
      "allowExternal": ["infrastructure", "composition"]
    },
    {
      "id": "arch:console",
      "type": "no-console",
      "root": "src",
      "layers": ["contracts", "domain", "application"]
    },
    {
      "id": "inject:declared",
      "type": "undeclared-inject",
      "root": "src",
      "note": "CHG-217：访问 ctx.<service> 却没在 inject 里声明的，宿主 Proxy 会在加载那一刻拒绝——整个插件行 did not activate。"
    },
    {
      "id": "depends:bare-name",
      "type": "bare-name-dependency",
      "root": "src",
      "note": "CHG-217：装载闭包只保证 @deepseek-ai/* 的一部分；裸名第三方包在本地「恰好能解析」，换到干净 profile 就炸。"
    },
    {
      "id": "session:messages",
      "type": "session-message-identity",
      "root": "src",
      "note": "CHG-217：交给会话的消息必须带 id——写入时不报错，用户下次打开会话时整段打不开。"
    },
    {
      "id": "session:custom-event",
      "type": "custom-session-event",
      "root": "src",
      "note": "CHG-217：session.append 的自定义事件类型必须先 augment SessionEventMap，否则写入被拒。"
    },
    {
      "id": "manifest:dsh-shape",
      "type": "manifest-shape",
      "manifest": "package.json",
      "note": "CHG-217：package.json 的 dsh 字段只写宿主认的键；自造字段宿主完全不读，只会误导下一个人。"
    },
    {
      "id": "release:pipeline",
      "type": "release-pipeline",
      "workflow": "../.github/workflows/release.yml",
      "note": "CHG-217：发版必须是 tag 驱动的那条固定流水线；publish 不能挂在 token 上，否则没配 secret 的仓库静默不发版。"
    }
  ]
}
